Then the reward from posting quote $a$ at time $t$ is
\[
r_t(a) = a \cdot \ind{\tau_t(a) \le T-t}.
\]

The regret is
\[
R(T)
=
\max_{a \in [0,1]} \mathbb{E}\left[\sum_{t=1}^T r_t(a)\right]
